{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u00ab</strong></i><strong>TRIVIA FANTASY<i>\u00bb</i></strong> is a knowledge-based RPG in which you must enter a mysterious tower filled with ancient artifacts and perilous creatures, in order to reach its final floor and save the world from a dying god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trivia Battles</strong> -\u00a0Defeat enemies by answering questions that test your knowledge, memory, and intuition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 1,000 Questions</strong> \u2013 A vast pool of trivia across multiple categories keeps every encounter fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RPG Progression</strong> -\u00a0Level up your party, grow your stats, and strategize like in the classics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Flavour</strong> - A classic interface with a nostalgic NES flavour.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endgame Challenges and Only Trivia mode\u00a0</strong>- Unlock Hardcore Mode and Randomizer Mode, the ultimate tests, or play an Only Trivia mode without game over.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3995310?t=1773870028","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3995310?t=1773870028","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995310/fb51d2d729c784f4ff1ce4a3ed9bb013aa0fa6fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773870028","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995310/fb51d2d729c784f4ff1ce4a3ed9bb013aa0fa6fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773870028","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demo